# Pioneer Survivors — GDD Authority

**Single primary doc:** `Assets/_Project/GAME_DESIGN_DOCUMENT_4.0.txt`

- **Chapters 1–5** — Dark Matter Studios Production Bible (vision / pillars / solo AAA strategy)
- **Appendix A** — Interim mechanics lock (roster, Echoes, thermal, Building Control Panels, economy, platforms) folded from GDD 3.0
- **Appendix B** — Current Implementation / Progress (what is playable vs planned)

**Archive only:** `Assets/_Project/GAME_DESIGN_DOCUMENT_3.0.txt` — superseded; do not treat as competing authority.

**Engineering rules:** `.cursor/rules/pioneer-survivor-unity-urp.mdc` (Unity 6 + URP, PC/consoles, combat/AI systems).

## Identity
- Year 2160, Io survival + light base-builder, semi-low-poly, **PC first + consoles**
- 25 pioneers max: **22 base** + **trio of 3** on expeditions
- Rescue procedural **Neural Echoes**; **Aether-9** memory cores → **Resonance Events**
- Materialize/craft/maintain buildings + **attachment modules** (generators, power grids, auto gather, logistics, communications, defense, mining); four biome pressures + **O₂ norm**

## Locked decisions (do not contradict)
- **Platforms:** PC (primary) + consoles (PS5 / Xbox) only. No mobile-as-target.
- **Economy:** **Aether Credits (AC) only**. Starter **5000 AC** → pick **1 starter Skilled Pioneer**. No external wallet, marketplace mint, or third-party crypto loop.
- **Echo / roster trading:** local save progression only — no marketplace trading of Echoes.
- **Thermal:** single **cold/heat** meter (one bar, two poles)
- **Pet:** fold legacy pet/AI follower into **Echo/trio** system — no separate pet loop (migration still outstanding in prototype)
- **Base 22:** impervious to most pressures; **sulfur storms** → Command Center rooms; building damage **injures, never kills**
- **Classes:** Architect Engineer, Science Specialist, Combat Tactician, Infiltrator Scout (+ hybrids)
- **Building Control Panels:** each major structure has an in-world terminal (E) → **Building Control UI** with tabs **Overview | Pioneers | Production | Craft | Changes**. Assign base-22 pioneers, queues, and per-building / module settings here. Planned attachment modules: generators, power grids, automated gather/logistics, communications, defense, mining. **Journal Craft = recipe library / scroll learning only** — not primary production UI. Queues pause in sulfur storms.

## Before building off-design
If the user asks for features unrelated to the GDD, **ask** whether it is canon, prototype, or a new direction. Prototypes OK when explicitly labeled.

## Unity scope
- Code lives under `Assets/_Project/`
- Reuse existing systems (combat, inventory, quests, save) where possible
- Prototype is flat terrain — Io biomes not shipped yet
- Prefer **Aether Credits** for all economy UI/save; strip leftover legacy currency naming when touching those systems
- Check GDD 4.0 **Appendix B** before assuming a vision system is missing or already shipped

